S: select 10 from the list plus 8 secondary, one more at levels three, six, nine and twelve (stored as related picks). Printed: Communications basic radio only; Domestic any (+10%); Electrical, Espionage, Mechanical, Military, Pilot Related, Rogue and Science none; Medical first aid, holistic medicine and paramedic only (+10%); Physical any; Pilot automobile, motorcycle and horse riding only (+5%); Technical any (+5%); W.P. any; Wilderness any (+5%). Motorcycle is the catalog''s Motorcycles & Snowmobiles row and horse riding is Horsemanship: General, which the catalog files in its own Horsemanship category (survey alias table), so it is offered as that category with the same +5%. Secondary skills use the same restricted categories with no bonus, per printed 39''s rule that secondary skills are selected from the list of available skill categories without the bonus. All new skills start at the base skill level is kept in the related note. BONUSES: +1 initiative, +3 perception, +1 dodge, +2 roll with fall or impact, +4 pull punch, +4 save vs magic (spell_magic), +3 save vs psionics, +5 save vs horror factor. The energy bolt''s +3 to strike applies only to that power and is prose under Powers of Light. MONEY: printed 192 says Guardians start with the clothes they were wearing and little else, and might have 2D4x10 dollars; the later 2D6x100 as allies help them is not starting money. WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT: rarely use weapons, dislike guns; nothing stored."
